# Settings sweep: the action bench's heaviest windows, shortened (about 70 s timed): Broker drive at
# noon, Hove Beach night drive in the rain, gunfight, explosions. Needs the career-street route save;
# run through tools/perf/settings_sweep.sh (or route_bench.sh pad). Windows: drive, night, combat,
# boom, all.
await 5m
wait 10s
nowanted
invincible
clock 13 0
weather 1

road 1040 150 20
car sultan
wait 6s
drive 18 0
mark all
mark drive
wait 20s
mark drive_end

road 892 -500 10
clock 21 30
weather 4
car infernus
wait 6s
drive 20 0
mark night
wait 15s
mark night_end

road 1040 150 20
clock 13 0
weather 1
wait 4s
weapon 14 9999
cars sultan 4 14
peds 8 1 12
wait 2s
mark combat
trigger lt 1
trigger rt 1 1.5s
wait 0.5s
trigger rt 1 1.5s
wait 0.5s
stick rx 0.6 1s
trigger rt 1 1.5s
wait 0.5s
stick rx -0.6 1s
trigger rt 1 1.5s
release all
mark combat_end

mark boom
explode 1
wait 2s
boom 12
wait 2s
explode 2
wait 3s
mark boom_end
mark all_end
shot {out}/shots/sweep.png 0.5
wait 1s
quit
